            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"does-it-actually-get-better\">Does it actually get better?</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each drain retries <strong>only</strong> what parked, under a fresh instinct pin. The loop stops\nitself when a drain closes nothing new \u2014 that is the termination condition, not a\ntimeout.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
