    {
      "id": "RGSE",
      "code_hash": "8a575635982299073a89556cc38ee26b",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"parked-waiting-on-a-human\">Parked \u2014 waiting on a human</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The attempt is preserved on a branch and the tree was restored, so every commit on the branch stays green.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>U-020</strong> \u00b7 <code>park/U-020</code> \u00b7 3 attempts</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">bridge surfaces step side effects, not tool returns</span>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"language-gdscript codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">AssertionError</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bridge</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">returned</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">tool</span><span class=\"s1\">'s value, not the step observation</span>\n<span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ow\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.31</span><span class=\"n\">s</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>U-023</strong> \u00b7 <code>park/U-023</code> \u00b7 3 attempts</span>\n<blockquote>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">both arms are always reported, never just the winner</span>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"language-css+lasso codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nt\">E</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"nt\">AssertionError</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">LBM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">arm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">was</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">reported</span><span class=\"o\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">descriptor</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">arm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">missing</span>\n<span class=\"nt\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nt\">0</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nc\">28s</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
